WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.900
World Masterpiece Theater

00:07.800 --> 00:14.400
Homeless Child Remy

00:07.800 --> 00:14.400
"About Love"

00:15.260 --> 00:23.200
I continue wishing to see you

00:23.690 --> 00:28.360
Today we'll go on a journey

00:28.450 --> 00:32.310
That's as endless as the blue sky

00:32.820 --> 00:40.990
With joy, sorrow and hope come setbacks

00:41.360 --> 00:46.040
They repeat, they repeat

00:46.280 --> 00:50.870
What should I believe?

00:51.510 --> 00:59.880
You know nothing about love, however

01:00.320 --> 01:08.900
Someday you will feel warmth inside

01:09.730 --> 01:19.860
I dream of the day when you'll speak of love

01:20.860 --> 01:28.660
Tomorrow, our journey will begin

01:29.510 --> 01:34.000
Presented by:
Takara Fansubs & Migoto

01:35.370 --> 01:40.000
Episode 10:
Lonely Arthur

01:46.460 --> 01:48.200
Joli-Coeur...?

01:49.560 --> 01:50.970
Joli-Coeur?

01:53.110 --> 01:54.450
Joli-Coeur?

01:55.950 --> 01:57.570
Where'd he go?

01:59.460 --> 02:00.810
Joli-Coeur?

02:05.350 --> 02:07.630
Hmm... That's strange...

02:12.070 --> 02:13.610
You haven't found him yet?

02:13.610 --> 02:16.520
No... I wonder where he's gone.

02:17.290 --> 02:19.460
I wish I could help you look for him,

02:19.460 --> 02:22.230
but today the doctor's visiting for the Madam’s son.

02:22.820 --> 02:25.200
That's all right. I'll look for him myself.

02:26.190 --> 02:26.980
Um...

02:28.920 --> 02:32.200
Does Mr. Arthur always behave like that?

02:35.050 --> 02:36.010
I'm sorry.

02:36.010 --> 02:38.870
The Madam's son is a kind and loving person.

02:39.970 --> 02:42.620
But... His health condition...

02:43.040 --> 02:47.130
Yes... He seldom wants to go out now.

02:57.290 --> 02:59.260
That was a stupid thing to say.

03:09.800 --> 03:10.900
Joli-Coeur!

03:17.790 --> 03:20.800
Ah... Sorry... I scared you.

03:22.290 --> 03:22.960
Come here.

03:25.120 --> 03:27.350
Come on. Nothing to be afraid of.

03:30.160 --> 03:31.300
You're so cute.

03:32.470 --> 03:35.140
So, your name's Joli-Coeur?

03:38.700 --> 03:39.600
What?

03:44.020 --> 03:46.100
Oh... I see.

03:46.100 --> 03:48.080
You want an apple, right?

03:49.290 --> 03:50.940
Okay! Okay!

03:59.740 --> 04:00.980
Ah!

04:01.660 --> 04:03.160
Just a second.

04:09.420 --> 04:10.880
Go on!

04:25.850 --> 04:27.490
T-thank you.

04:30.550 --> 04:32.570
I envy you.

04:33.350 --> 04:36.280
I wish I could do whatever I want like you can.

04:36.960 --> 04:38.980
I want to go to so many places.

04:38.980 --> 04:40.370
Shall I take you there?

04:41.830 --> 04:44.520
I will take you anywhere.

04:48.060 --> 04:49.880
I've been looking for you, Joli-Coeur.

04:53.710 --> 04:56.390
It's not good you go out by yourself.

04:57.090 --> 04:58.470
For me?

04:58.470 --> 05:00.220
Thank you.

05:05.790 --> 05:07.640
Yummm... delicious.

05:21.160 --> 05:23.140
Come on, let's go for a walk.

05:23.140 --> 05:24.920
I'll push you.

05:24.920 --> 05:26.520
Don't! Mind your own business!

05:42.000 --> 05:45.520
I-it was just to comfort him...

05:52.910 --> 05:54.150
Oh, no.

05:54.150 --> 05:58.150
So, you mean my son won't be able to walk again?

05:59.280 --> 06:00.660
Probably...

06:00.660 --> 06:02.230
Oh, no...

06:04.740 --> 06:07.320
His legs have feeling.

06:07.320 --> 06:08.300
And...

06:09.230 --> 06:11.750
He's become strong physically.

06:11.750 --> 06:15.850
Yes... There's nothing to worry about his health.

06:15.850 --> 06:17.760
The localized medical treatment worked well.

06:18.260 --> 06:19.590
So then...

06:19.590 --> 06:21.760
But his legs...

06:30.550 --> 06:31.600
Madam...

06:31.980 --> 06:35.210
Please, don't abandon him.

06:35.760 --> 06:39.110
I've been doing as much as I can, but...

06:51.510 --> 06:52.790
Mother.

06:53.590 --> 06:56.300
I told you it would be like this.

06:56.300 --> 06:57.380
Huh?

06:57.870 --> 07:01.630
The doctor said that I would never be able to walk again, right?

07:01.630 --> 07:02.960
Ah...

07:05.060 --> 07:07.140
There's no need to hide it.

07:07.140 --> 07:09.860
I already knew.

07:12.450 --> 07:13.490
Arthur...

07:14.560 --> 07:16.230
Don't give up.

07:16.230 --> 07:19.330
I will find a good treatment no matter what.

07:19.330 --> 07:23.820
If I find good doctors, I will take you to them. I will do anything.

07:25.460 --> 07:26.830
That's enough.

07:27.380 --> 07:29.950
Arthur, please, don't give up.

07:30.560 --> 07:32.960
Let's calm down and talk.

07:33.320 --> 07:35.220
There's nothing to talk about.

07:35.220 --> 07:39.490
Arthur, please listen to the Madam.

07:40.710 --> 07:42.120
Arthur.

07:42.120 --> 07:44.950
That's enough. I can't walk anymore.

07:44.950 --> 07:46.640
I'll be a burden to you my whole life.

07:48.740 --> 07:49.890
Why are you saying this?

07:50.430 --> 07:54.650
No more doctors, medicines or injections. No more!

07:56.210 --> 07:57.360
Madam!

08:00.980 --> 08:02.140
Wait!

08:04.410 --> 08:06.320
What did you do to your mother?

08:08.590 --> 08:09.830
Apologize.

08:10.300 --> 08:12.320
She is worrying about you, but...

08:12.320 --> 08:13.580
Apologize.

08:13.580 --> 08:14.790
What are you going to do?

08:14.790 --> 08:16.490
Get off of me. Get off of me.

08:16.490 --> 08:18.410
Not until you apologize.
- Remy!

08:18.410 --> 08:19.470
Stop.

08:20.560 --> 08:22.200
That's enough.

08:22.200 --> 08:24.300
Please stop, Remy.

08:25.720 --> 08:27.440
I hate this.

08:27.440 --> 08:29.390
I hate all of you.

08:29.390 --> 08:30.710
Wait!

08:30.710 --> 08:31.760
Arthur!

08:33.080 --> 08:35.580
I... I...

08:37.430 --> 08:38.920
I know...

08:38.920 --> 08:40.730
The Madam understands too.

08:41.330 --> 08:44.550
I thought it was wrong to treat your mother like that.

08:44.550 --> 08:47.950
Treating her like that, is wrong.

08:51.010 --> 08:51.950
Come here.

08:54.830 --> 08:58.830
She knows that it's not good to spoil him.

08:58.830 --> 09:02.000
But her son is the Madam's life.

09:02.640 --> 09:05.650
She lost her husband a long time ago,

09:05.650 --> 09:10.120
and her first child was kidnapped when it was a baby.

09:10.120 --> 09:11.470
Kidnapped?

09:11.470 --> 09:12.940
Yes.

09:12.940 --> 09:16.580
So, only her son, Arthur, is left for her.

09:16.580 --> 09:18.220
Only her son.

09:26.930 --> 09:28.740
Arthur, open the door.

09:29.140 --> 09:31.740
Please, listen to me.

09:47.560 --> 09:51.300
I won't be able to walk. I won't be able to...

09:59.270 --> 10:01.830
I won't be able to walk for the rest of my life.

10:12.910 --> 10:15.790
Arthur, what happened? Open the door.

10:17.960 --> 10:19.030
Arthur?

10:20.350 --> 10:21.730
Arthur!

11:05.330 --> 11:07.170
You're leaving?

11:07.830 --> 11:09.670
Why?

11:09.670 --> 11:12.070
Don't you like it here?

11:12.070 --> 11:14.180
No... It's not that.

11:14.180 --> 11:18.150
Well... I'm worried about Mr. Vitalis after all,

11:18.790 --> 11:20.680
and I feel bad about troubling you.

11:21.050 --> 11:22.820
Troubling... Never...

11:22.820 --> 11:24.690
Madam!

11:25.690 --> 11:27.150
It's awful... Your son...

11:27.630 --> 11:28.110
Huh?

11:28.110 --> 11:31.420
Your son... He's nowhere to be found.

11:31.420 --> 11:33.210
Not in his room, not in the backyard.

11:33.210 --> 11:33.860
What?

11:45.270 --> 11:46.550
Arthur!

11:47.070 --> 11:48.410
Arthur!

11:48.410 --> 11:50.840
Master Arthur!

11:51.200 --> 11:52.780
Master Arthur!

11:52.780 --> 11:54.840
Mr. Arthur!

11:54.840 --> 11:56.260
Master Arthur!

11:56.260 --> 11:57.890
Where are you?

11:57.890 --> 12:00.100
Master Arthur!

12:00.100 --> 12:02.440
Please answer us!

12:03.610 --> 12:05.450
Mr. Arthur!

12:07.520 --> 12:08.540
Master Arthur!

12:08.540 --> 12:09.610
Arthur!

12:12.110 --> 12:13.850
Where are you!?

12:13.850 --> 12:16.260
Master Arthur!

12:18.680 --> 12:19.950
Arthur...

12:22.120 --> 12:24.160
Arthur!

12:25.120 --> 12:27.250
Master Arthur's lap blanket.

12:29.290 --> 12:31.630
That means Arthur passed by here.

12:33.380 --> 12:35.090
Give it to me.

12:37.910 --> 12:39.620
Guys, smell this.

12:41.850 --> 12:44.390
Right. Look for Mr. Arthur.

12:59.410 --> 13:00.660
He found him.

13:13.300 --> 13:15.670
Oh no! There's a river over there.

13:15.670 --> 13:16.840
Huh?

13:16.840 --> 13:19.510
Remy! I'll go and call the Madam.

15:08.710 --> 15:10.750
Here? Is he here?

15:16.170 --> 15:17.340
It can't be.

15:18.000 --> 15:20.130
Mr. Arthur!

15:20.130 --> 15:22.980
If you're there, please answer me!

15:25.640 --> 15:27.890
Mr. Arthur!

15:41.640 --> 15:42.490
You...

15:45.580 --> 15:47.200
Oh no! All the way down there...

15:47.640 --> 15:50.600
Mr. Arthur, please don't let go!

15:50.600 --> 15:51.210
Capi!

15:52.350 --> 15:53.980
Please go and bring everyone here.

15:53.980 --> 15:56.120
Understand? Bark and bring them here.

16:00.330 --> 16:03.030
Please hang in there and hold on. I'm coming now.

16:18.790 --> 16:20.030
You're not hurt?

16:25.030 --> 16:27.530
Now, please take my hand and hold on.

16:28.240 --> 16:30.780
Don't! Don't come any closer.

16:30.780 --> 16:32.040
Go away.

16:33.050 --> 16:34.400
What are you saying?

16:34.400 --> 16:35.950
Hurry up! This is dangerous.

16:35.950 --> 16:37.920
Here, grab on!

16:37.920 --> 16:39.000
Leave me alone.

16:41.070 --> 16:43.680
Arthur! Grab my hand now.

16:43.680 --> 16:45.090
Hurry up!

16:45.090 --> 16:46.340
I want to stay here.

16:46.780 --> 16:48.010
What are you talking about?

16:48.010 --> 16:50.290
If you stay there any longer, you'll fall and die.

16:50.290 --> 16:52.850
I don't care what happens to me.

16:52.850 --> 16:54.350
Don't care?

16:55.530 --> 16:59.110
Arthur... Do you really want to die?

17:05.120 --> 17:08.170
Arthur... Stop being stupid. Grab my hand.

17:08.170 --> 17:10.370
Shut up! Leave me alone.

17:10.370 --> 17:13.530
If you die, what will your mother do?

17:13.530 --> 17:15.620
Are you really going to leave your mother alone?

17:27.300 --> 17:30.060
Arthur... Arthur...

17:40.310 --> 17:43.490
Arthur, it's not good to die.

17:43.490 --> 17:46.070
Everyone's worried about you.

17:46.930 --> 17:49.060
Because my body is like this...

17:49.060 --> 17:51.830
That's why they're worried about me.

17:53.010 --> 17:54.310
You're wrong.

17:54.310 --> 17:56.080
It's because they love you.

17:57.380 --> 18:00.680
I make my mother cry all the time.

18:00.680 --> 18:03.120
I'm just trouble for everyone.

18:03.120 --> 18:04.590
If I...

18:04.590 --> 18:07.000
It'll be better if I'm gone.

18:09.430 --> 18:11.330
You're wrong, Arthur.

18:11.330 --> 18:13.600
You are your mother's purpose in life.

18:14.390 --> 18:16.600
If she loses you,

18:18.790 --> 18:20.600
she will die too.

18:21.280 --> 18:22.790
You don't care if that happens?

18:25.680 --> 18:26.950
Please...

18:26.950 --> 18:29.110
Don't just think about yourself.

18:30.150 --> 18:32.370
Think about your mother, too.

18:37.140 --> 18:41.130
Please, be brave for your mother's sake.

18:43.420 --> 18:44.380
Remy...

18:51.050 --> 18:53.800
Arthur! Arthur!

18:54.180 --> 18:55.680
Mother!

18:55.680 --> 18:58.190
Now Arthur, grab on!

19:08.890 --> 19:10.350
Arthur!

19:11.170 --> 19:12.110
Arthur?

19:32.480 --> 19:34.050
Arthur?

19:35.580 --> 19:36.620
Arthur?

19:38.560 --> 19:39.960
Arthur.

19:39.960 --> 19:41.060
Thank goodness!

19:41.980 --> 19:43.540
Mother...

19:43.540 --> 19:44.560
Remy...

19:44.560 --> 19:46.780
Arthur...

19:46.780 --> 19:49.820
Thank goodness. Oh, thank goodness.

19:51.570 --> 19:52.660
Mother.

19:52.660 --> 19:54.370
Arthur.

19:56.340 --> 19:57.580
Mother...

20:00.610 --> 20:05.590
Mother... I'm sorry.  I... I...

20:06.070 --> 20:07.070
Arthur!

20:09.240 --> 20:11.210
Arthur!

20:21.780 --> 20:24.380
Remy... It's thanks to you.

20:24.380 --> 20:26.070
Thank you so much.

20:42.610 --> 20:43.910
Remy...

20:55.350 --> 20:56.730
Mary?

20:56.730 --> 20:58.140
Yes, Madam.

20:58.140 --> 21:01.520
I want Remy to stay here.

21:02.220 --> 21:05.330
If my daughter had been alive, she would have been Remy's age.

21:11.600 --> 21:13.650
Hey, Joli-Coeur...  Stop it.

21:13.500 --> 21:21.900
Surely, living is wonderful

21:18.100 --> 21:20.720
I don't know why but I don't feel like she's a stranger.

21:22.180 --> 21:24.160
I want to adopt her.

21:23.170 --> 21:33.800
My hand is upon the left side of my beating chest...

21:25.300 --> 21:27.260
Yes, Madam.

21:34.500 --> 21:44.180
Tomorrow start walking

21:42.310 --> 21:43.450
Vitalis!

21:44.400 --> 21:54.030
You won't cross paths with happiness

21:44.790 --> 21:45.430
Get out!

21:54.270 --> 22:02.300
Try to look at them more

22:03.910 --> 22:07.430
You're beautiful now that

22:07.790 --> 22:19.310
Your eyes are filled with laughter

22:20.150 --> 22:29.720
Tomorrow I promise that

22:30.030 --> 22:39.860
There will always be mistakes but

22:40.010 --> 22:48.280
Try to seek for them more

22:49.550 --> 22:53.210
Give your heart to

22:53.480 --> 23:07.830
That person who is also seeking you

23:20.220 --> 23:21.610
Mr. Vitalis!

23:23.670 --> 23:25.080
What did you say?

23:25.510 --> 23:27.970
Leave Remy with me?

23:28.830 --> 23:30.080
Mr. Vitalis!

23:30.450 --> 23:33.080
Don't go without me!

23:33.080 --> 23:36.920
<i>The Secret of the Pendant</i>

23:33.080 --> 23:36.920
Next time:
